{"channelId":"UCrWey_CyAAqFpOgiKB2KUyw","row":["Pivot Point Performance",1958,"Pivot Point Performance is a horse-and-rider wellness company dedicated to helping both ends of the partnership move, feel, and perform at their best.\n\nWe specialize in a whole-body, whole-system approach—combining physical therapy, assisted stretching, rider evaluations, and equine bodywork to identify and address the root causes of pain, restriction, or performance limitations.\n\nWhether you’re a competitive athlete, weekend rider, or simply want you and your horse to feel better, our goal is to create better communication, improved movement, and longer-lasting soundness for both horse and rider.\n\nThrough hands-on sessions, customized programs, and educational clinics, we don’t just treat symptoms—we give you the tools and understanding to take control of your progress.\n\nBecause when both horse and rider move better… everything changes.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrWey_CyAAqFpOgiKB2KUyw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrWey_CyAAqFpOgiKB2KUyw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:03.578Z","channelId":"UCrWey_CyAAqFpOgiKB2KUyw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"eba1524458a1794652b985b5d852282d84e5fe07f9eb04a5ab3ddfe74bc6fe37","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"359e487c9720cc508faeebaa7e150f51a41bd3803a621ca5413a98ace20f6693"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/pivotpointequine","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1958,"raw":"1,958","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/pivotpointequine/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T04:25:09.377Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrWey_CyAAqFpOgiKB2KUyw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1560,"raw":"1.56K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrWey_CyAAqFpOgiKB2KUyw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:03.578Z"}],